---

<section id="equipe" class="w-full py-20 md:py-28 bg-elan-sand/40 border-t border-elan-border/40">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Circular Image Column with Mask Reveal (5 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative w-64 h-64 sm:w-80 sm:h-80 rounded-full overflow-hidden shadow-xl border-4 border-white/80 mask-reveal-circle">
          <img
            src="/images/dra-especialista.webp"
            alt="Dra. Gabriela Fontes - Élan Estética"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            width="640"
            height="640"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Bio Column (7 cols) -->
      <div class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <span class="text-[11px] font-sans font-bold tracking-[3px] uppercase text-elan-green mb-3">
          Responsável Técnica
        </span>

        <!-- SplitText target -->
        <h2 class="split-reveal font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-normal text-elan-text leading-[1.15] mb-6">
          Conhecimento com delicadeza.
        </h2>

        <p class="font-sans text-sm sm:text-base text-elan-muted font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Dra. Gabriela Fontes combina anos de dedicação à estética avançada e dermocosmética com um olhar sensível e individualizado para cada paciente.
        </p>

        <p class="font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm text-elan-muted font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Membro de associações internacionais de dermatologia estética, seu propósito é realçar traços naturais sem exageros, priorizando a saúde cutânea a longo prazo.
        </p>

        <div>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/5511999999999?text=Ol%C3%A1!%20Gostaria%20de%20agendar%20uma%20consulta%20com%20a%20Dra.%20Gabriela%20Fontes%20na%20%C3%89lan%20Est%C3%A9tica."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold tracking-wider uppercase h-11 px-7 rounded-full border border-elan-green text-elan-green hover:bg-elan-green hover:text-white transition-all duration-200 active:scale-95 shadow-sm cursor-pointer"
          >
            Agendar com a especialista
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
